## Song Structures

Pick one. Don't default to the same structure every time.

### Standard (most common)
```
[Intro] → [Verse 1] → [Chorus] → [Verse 2] → [Chorus] → [Bridge] → [Chorus] → [Outro]
```

### Hook-First (Drake method — hook grabs attention immediately)
```
[Chorus] → [Verse 1] → [Chorus] → [Verse 2] → [Chorus]
```

### Verse-Heavy (when bars are the point)
```
[Verse 1] → [Chorus] → [Verse 2] → [Chorus] → [Verse 3] → [Chorus]
```

### Storytelling (Kendrick/Nas — narrative arc)
```
[Intro - Spoken] → [Verse 1] → [Chorus] → [Verse 2] → [Bridge] → [Verse 3] → [Outro]
```

### Short Track (Quebo energy — say it and get out)
```
[Verse 1] → [Chorus] → [Verse 2] → [Chorus]
```

### No Chorus (pure bars, underground)
```
[Verse 1] → [Verse 2] → [Verse 3] → [Outro]
```

### Bookend (spoken frame — self-aware)
```
[Intro - Spoken] → [Verse 1] → [Chorus] → [Verse 2] → [Chorus] → [Outro - Spoken]
```

