## The Three Layers (from style.md)

Every song file has three layers, in this order:

### 1. Lyrics
The actual song — section tags, bars, adlibs. This is what gets pasted into Suno.

### 2. Suno Style Prompts
After a blank line below the lyrics. 4 style prompts, separated by blank lines. Plain text, no backticks (easy to copy-paste into Suno).

### 3. Flow Notes
Inside `<!-- flow notes: -->` HTML comment. Invisible to Suno, visible to the artist. Contains:
- **Changes made** — line-by-line edit log
- **Adlibs added** — adlib strategy explanation
- **Held back** — suggestions the artist can choose to apply

For tracks rewritten in a specific style (e.g., Quebo), use the appropriate notes tag: `<!-- quebo notes: -->`.

